<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Electromagnetic pulse grenades damaging to electronic equipment strapped to a belt. They can be thrown a short distance, where they'll explode, disabling any electronics for a brief duration.-->
  <VWE_Apparel_GrenadeEMPBelt.description>别在腰带上的电磁脉冲（EMP）手榴弹，爆炸后可以暂时瘫痪附近的机械体、炮塔和迫击炮，并立即耗尽护盾的能量。\n\n可使用EMP手榴弹重新装填。</VWE_Apparel_GrenadeEMPBelt.description>
  <!--EN: EMP grenade belt-->
  <VWE_Apparel_GrenadeEMPBelt.label>EMP手榴弹腰带</VWE_Apparel_GrenadeEMPBelt.label>
  <!--EN: throw EMP grenade-->
  <VWE_Apparel_GrenadeEMPBelt.verbs.0.label>投掷电磁脉冲手榴弹</VWE_Apparel_GrenadeEMPBelt.verbs.0.label>
  <!--EN: Old-school fragmentation grenades strapped to a belt. They can be thrown a short distance, where they'll explode, damaging anything and anyone nearby. Can be reloaded using frag grenades.-->
  <VWE_Apparel_GrenadeFragBelt.description>别在腰带上的老式破片手榴弹。它们能被扔到不远的位置，当它们爆炸的时候，会伤害到附近的任何人和物体。\n\n可使用破片手榴弹重新装填。</VWE_Apparel_GrenadeFragBelt.description>
  <!--EN: frag grenade belt-->
  <VWE_Apparel_GrenadeFragBelt.label>破片手榴弹腰带</VWE_Apparel_GrenadeFragBelt.label>
  <!--EN: throw frag grenade-->
  <VWE_Apparel_GrenadeFragBelt.verbs.0.label>投掷破片手榴弹</VWE_Apparel_GrenadeFragBelt.verbs.0.label>
  <!--EN: Glass bottles filled with flammable liquid, with a burning cloth in the neck, strapped to a belt. A favorite weapon of hooligans and desperate warriors from rim to rim. They can be thrown a short distance, where they'll explode, damaging anything and anyone nearby, setting chemfuel on fire. Can be reloaded using molotovs.-->
  <VWE_Apparel_GrenadeMolotovBelt.description>别在腰带上的装有易燃液体的玻璃瓶，瓶口有一块燃烧的布。边缘世界的恶棍和敢死战士们的最爱。\n\n可使用燃烧瓶重新装填。</VWE_Apparel_GrenadeMolotovBelt.description>
  <!--EN: molotov belt-->
  <VWE_Apparel_GrenadeMolotovBelt.label>燃烧瓶腰带</VWE_Apparel_GrenadeMolotovBelt.label>
  <!--EN: throw molotov-->
  <VWE_Apparel_GrenadeMolotovBelt.verbs.0.label>投掷燃烧弹</VWE_Apparel_GrenadeMolotovBelt.verbs.0.label>
</LanguageData>
